    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n103478" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τετρά̆-πηχυς</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">υ</span>,
